  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Ireland&apos;s Gender Partnership with the International Finance Corporation (IFC), a financial institution focused on quality private sector engagement for development which forms part of the World Bank Group, advances gender equality within the context of a green, resilient, and inclusive recovery. In line with the World Bank Group&#x2019;s Gender Strategy, the IFC Gender Partnership addresses gender gaps to create markets that afford all genders the same economic and social opportunities and choices.</narrative>
  </description>
